title: Proposition 17
---
order: 17
---
short_label: X.17
---
statement: <b><a href="propX17.html#lemma">Lemma.</a></b> If to any straight line there is applied a parallelogram but falling short by a square, then the applied parallelogram equals the rectangle contained by the segments of the straight line resulting from the application.
